From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:05:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: Report whether a fetch was suspended

Net ignores a suspension when it does not read the body from the
network (a cache hit, another scheme, or after the end) and when two
fetches to the origin of the request are suspended already, and nothing
told the consumer. A media element that suspended its fetch then kept
queueing a body that kept arriving, up to its 32 MiB cap, which it
discarded to restart the fetch, while its networkState said the
download was suspended.

Let the suspension carry an optional GenericCallback, to which the
resource thread sends the result of CancellationListener::suspend: true
if the fetch is suspended now, false if the suspension was ignored. A
GenericCallback works in both single-process and multi-process mode,
and runs in the process that suspended the fetch, so the consumer can
queue a task from it.

Fork note: meant for upstream. Drop once upstream has it.

Testing: a unit test suspends three fetches to one origin through
FetchController and the resource thread: the first two are reported as
suspended and the third not, and a suspension after the end of a fetch
is reported as ignored.

Validation: `./mach test-unit -p servo-net`: 413 tests pass (412 before); the new test passed five runs in a row, and fails when the resource thread always reports a suspension. `./mach check --ohos` passes.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; implemented and tested by the agent)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 components/net/resource_thread.rs             |  9 +-
 components/net/tests/http_loader.rs           | 83 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../shared/net/fetch/fetch_controller.rs      |  8 +-
 components/shared/net/lib.rs                  | 18 ++--
 4 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/net/resource_thread.rs b/components/net/resource_thread.rs
index 90616464950..0cb7ec88e43 100644
--- a/components/net/resource_thread.rs
+++ b/components/net/resource_thread.rs
@@ -454,9 +454,12 @@ impl ResourceChannelManager {
                     cancellation_listener.cancel();
                 }
             },
-            CoreResourceMsg::Suspend(request_id) => {
-                if let Some(cancellation_listener) = self.cancellation_listener(request_id) {
-                    let _ = cancellation_listener.suspend();
+            CoreResourceMsg::Suspend(request_id, reply) => {
+                let suspended = self
+                    .cancellation_listener(request_id)
+                    .is_some_and(|cancellation_listener| cancellation_listener.suspend());
+                if let Some(reply) = reply {
+                    let _ = reply.send(suspended);
                 }
             },
             CoreResourceMsg::Resume(request_id) => {
